LogHack - a logfile analyzer for NetHack written in Perl:
http://freshmeat.net/projects/loghack/

About:
LogHack is a logfile analyzer for NetHack. It produces many different 
statistics sorted by Score, MaxLevel, DeathLevel, HitPoints, MaxHp, DeathsCount,
latest entry, age, and top reasons for End. It also shows the most commonly 
used races, roles, player names, login names, alignment, gender, and NetHack 
version. The "top monsters" are also shown.


